<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>WSE-3 · Numbers across PEs</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#293e51;--muted:#728496;--paper:#fff;--bg:#f5f5ef;--line:#dbe4e5;--green:#098572;--soft:#e8f5ef;--amber:#b76d18}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}main{max-width:1370px;margin:auto;padding:36px}h1{font-size:43px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:12px 0}h2{font-size:22px;margin:8px 0}h3{font-size:16px}p{margin:8px 0 16px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:750}.muted,small{color:var(--muted)}.card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px;margin:20px 0;min-width:0}select,button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:8px;cursor:pointer;max-width:100%}button:hover{border-color:var(--green)}button.active{color:var(--green);background:var(--soft);border-color:var(--green)}.controls{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end}.controls label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.controls label select{color:var(--ink);font-size:14px}.words{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:15px 0}.words button{min-width:60px}.words small{display:block;font-size:10px}.words b{font-size:19px}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:20px}.two>.card{margin:0}.scroll{overflow:auto;max-width:100%}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px}td,th{padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}th{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.mono,code{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:3px 8px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:4px;color:var(--green);font-size:11px}.limit{border-left:3px solid var(--amber);padding:10px 16px;background:#fff7e9;font-size:12px}.milestones{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px;margin:20px 0}.milestone{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:13px;background:var(--paper);text-align:left}.milestone.reached{background:var(--soft);border-color:var(--green)}.milestone span,.milestone small{display:block}.milestone b{font-size:22px;color:var(--green)}.milestone span{font-size:12px}.milestone small{font-size:10px}.clock{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}.clock input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--green);min-width:80px}.clock b{font:24px ui-monospace,monospace}svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}svg text{font:13px system-ui,sans-serif;fill:var(--ink)}svg .small{font-size:11px;fill:var(--muted)}svg .value{font:24px ui-monospace,monospace;fill:var(--green);font-weight:650}.equation{font-size:30px;color:var(--green);margin:15px 0}.stats{display:flex;gap:25px;flex-wrap:wrap}.stats b{font-size:24px;color:var(--green)}.stats small{display:block;font-size:11px}.instruction{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px;border-radius:6px;margin:12px 0}.raw{max-height:350px;overflow:auto}details{margin:18px 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}a{color:var(--green)}footer{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:20px 0}.nobreak{white-space:nowrap}
@media(max-width:900px){main{padding:16px}.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:33px}.card{padding:16px}.milestones{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.controls{gap:10px}.controls label{width:100%}.controls select{width:100%}}
</style><main>
<header><span class="eyebrow">WSE-3 / PE-TO-PE DATAFLOW</span><h1>Follow the number across the mesh.</h1><p>Full payload bits connect a sending instruction, router observations, a receiving instruction, and the arithmetic that uses the value.</p><span class="badge">Recorded simulator cycles</span> <span class="badge">Exact f32 words</span></header>
<section class="card"><div class="stats" id="stats"></div><p class="muted">Each bound message passes full-vector, endpoint, packet-identity, control-bit, instruction-value, and chronology checks. Unmatched observations are retained separately.</p><div class="controls"><label>Workload<select id="scene"></select></label><label>Transfer<select id="message"></select></label><button id="export">Export evidence</button></div><div id="words" class="words"></div><h2 id="selected"></h2><div class="clock"><button id="prev" aria-label="Previous observation">←</button><input id="cycle" type="range" aria-label="Cycle"><button id="next" aria-label="Next observation">→</button><b id="clock"></b></div><div id="milestones" class="milestones"></div><p class="limit">The five boxes mark observations, not physical pipeline stages. An interval between router records can include waiting and backpressure; it is not a measurement of pure wire latency. Buffer writeback and queue occupancy remain unobserved.</p></section>
<div class="two"><section class="card"><span class="eyebrow">SPATIAL PATH</span><h2>Same identity. Same complete word.</h2><svg id="mesh" viewBox="0 0 530 380" role="img" aria-label="Selected PE-to-PE transfer"></svg><p id="route-note" class="muted"></p><p id="word" class="mono"></p></section><section class="card"><span class="eyebrow">COMPUTATION AT THE DESTINATION</span><h2 id="consumer-title"></h2><div class="equation" id="equation"></div><p id="consumer-note"></p><div id="instructions"></div><p class="muted"><small>The receive operation’s S6 value record is not an SRAM write timestamp. The subsequent numeric use is bound to a separate arithmetic instruction. A final replica has no required arithmetic use in this program.</small></p></section></div>
<section class="card"><span class="eyebrow">EVERY WORD IN THIS MESSAGE</span><h2>The ordered vector binds repeated values.</h2><div class="scroll" id="message-table"></div><p id="control-note" class="mono"></p><p class="muted"><small>Tensor indices come from the program’s packing order and verified buffers. Packet identity and full-word equality establish the observed endpoint pair. Equality of a scalar by itself is insufficient.</small></p><details><summary>Raw record references and scope</summary><p id="source" class="mono"></p><div id="raw" class="scroll raw"></div></details></section>
<section class="card"><span class="eyebrow">THE DECISIVE NEXT PROBE</span><h2>Separate distance from receiver readiness.</h2><p>Hold the payload and route fixed, then vary when the receiver starts consuming. Sweep message length across the input-queue capacity. Next repeat with passive transit PEs and an east-to-south turn, keeping SRAM relay/computation as a separate treatment.</p><p>Compare sender S6 → source-router observation, each adjacent router interval, destination-router observation → receive S6, and receive S6 → first arithmetic use. Preserve the exact packet words and identities throughout.</p><p class="limit">A passive router hop and a PE that receives into SRAM, computes, and sends a new message are different paths. The latter creates new packet identities and needs an explicit value lineage across the compute step.</p><p>These adjacent-PE bindings establish the measurement method; they do not measure a new multi-hop or queue-readiness sweep.</p></section>
<footer>Offline HTML + SVG · source: tools/pe_hops.py · <a href="../../PE_HOP_REVIEW.md">Evidence and reproduction guide</a></footer></main>
<script id="hop-data" type="application/json">__DATA__</script><script>
const DATA=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('hop-data').textContent),$=id=>document.getElementById(id),esc=x=>String(x??'—').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c])),hex=n=>'0x'+n.toString(16).padStart(8,'0');
const table=(hs,rows)=>`<table><thead><tr>${hs.map(h=>`<th>${esc(h)}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr>${r.map(c=>`<td>${c}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>`;
let si=0,mi=0,slot=0,cycle=0;
$('stats').innerHTML=`<div><b>${DATA.scenes.reduce((n,s)=>n+s.counts.data_packets_bound,0)}</b><small>data packets bound</small></div><div><b>${DATA.scenes.reduce((n,s)=>n+s.messages.length,0)}</b><small>complete ordered messages</small></div><div><b>${DATA.scenes.length}</b><small>GEMV / GEMM cases</small></div>`;
$('scene').innerHTML=DATA.scenes.map((s,i)=>`<option value="${i}">${s.title}</option>`).join('');
function frames(q){return [{title:'Send S6',cycle:q.send.cycle,detail:'copy operand/result record'},{title:'Source router',cycle:q.packet.observations[0].cycle,detail:'wavelet observed on ramp'},{title:'Destination router',cycle:q.packet.observations[1].cycle,detail:'same packet and word'},{title:'Receive S6',cycle:q.receive.cycle,detail:'copy operand/result record'},{title:'Arithmetic use',cycle:q.consumer?.cycle,detail:q.consumer?.equation||'no further use required'}];}
function chooseScene(){si=+$('scene').value;mi=0;$('message').innerHTML=DATA.scenes[si].messages.map((m,i)=>`<option value="${i}">${esc(m.label)} · (${m.source}) → (${m.destination})</option>`).join('');chooseMessage();}
function chooseMessage(){mi=+$('message').value;slot=0;cycle=DATA.scenes[si].messages[mi].terms[0].packet.observations[1].cycle;render();}
function render(){const s=DATA.scenes[si],m=s.messages[mi],q=m.terms[slot],f=frames(q),times=f.filter(x=>x.cycle!=null).map(x=>x.cycle);$('cycle').min=Math.min(...times);$('cycle').max=Math.max(...times);$('cycle').value=cycle;$('clock').textContent=cycle;$('selected').textContent=`${q.semantic} = ${q.value} · PE (${m.source}) → PE (${m.destination})`;
$('words').innerHTML=m.terms.map((t,i)=>`<button data-slot="${i}" class="${i===slot?'active':''}"><small>word ${i}</small><b>${t.value}</b></button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-slot]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{slot=+b.dataset.slot;cycle=m.terms[slot].packet.observations[1].cycle;render();});
$('milestones').innerHTML=f.map((x,i)=>`<button class="milestone ${x.cycle!=null&&cycle>=x.cycle?'reached':''}" ${x.cycle==null?'disabled':''} data-cycle="${x.cycle}"><span>${x.title}</span><b>${x.cycle??'—'}</b><small>${esc(x.detail)}</small><small>${i&&x.cycle!=null?'Δ '+(x.cycle-f[i-1].cycle)+' cycles':''}</small></button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-cycle]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{cycle=+b.dataset.cycle;render();});
const xy=pe=>pe.split(',').map(Number),pos=pe=>{const [x,y]=xy(pe);return [45+x*270,30+y*185]},[sx,sy]=pos(m.source),[dx,dy]=pos(m.destination);let svg=`<defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10" fill="#b76d18"/></marker></defs>`;
for(const pe of Object.keys(s.placement)){const [x,y]=pos(pe);const endpoint=pe===m.source||pe===m.destination;svg+=`<g><rect x="${x}" y="${y}" width="165" height="140" rx="8" fill="${endpoint?'#e8f5ef':'#f6f7f7'}" stroke="${endpoint?'#098572':'#dbe4e5'}"/><text x="${x+14}" y="${y+28}">PE (${pe})</text><text class="small" x="${x+14}" y="${y+49}">fabric (${s.placement[pe].fabric})</text>${endpoint?`<text class="value" x="${x+14}" y="${y+87}">${pe===m.source?(cycle>=q.send.cycle?q.value:'?'):(cycle>=q.packet.observations[1].cycle?q.value:'?')}</text><text class="small" x="${x+14}" y="${y+114}">${pe===m.source?'source copy observation':cycle>=q.receive.cycle?'receive value observed':cycle>=q.packet.observations[1].cycle?'at router; buffer unknown':'not yet observed here'}</text>`:''}</g>`;}
const horizontal=sy===dy,sign=horizontal?Math.sign(dx-sx):Math.sign(dy-sy),ax=horizontal?sx+(sign>0?165:0):sx+83,ay=horizontal?sy+70:sy+(sign>0?140:0),bx=horizontal?dx+(sign>0?0:165):dx+83,by=horizontal?dy+70:dy+(sign>0?0:140);svg+=`<path d="M${ax} ${ay}L${bx} ${by}" fill="none" stroke="#b76d18" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><text class="small" x="${horizontal?(ax+bx)/2+2:ax+10}" y="${horizontal?ay-12:(ay+by)/2}" ${horizontal?'text-anchor="middle"':''}>${q.packet.interval} cycles</text>`;$('mesh').innerHTML=svg;
$('route-note').textContent=`Color ${q.packet.color} · ident ${q.packet.ident}. The arrow joins two observed router locations; no intermediate packet position or queue occupancy is asserted.`;$('word').textContent=`index ${hex(q.packet.observations[0].index)} · data ${hex(q.packet.observations[0].data)} → ${hex(q.packet.word)} → f32 ${q.value}`;
$('consumer-title').textContent=q.consumer?'The received value becomes an operand.':'A checked output replica.';$('equation').textContent=q.consumer?(cycle>=q.consumer.cycle?q.consumer.equation:'Arithmetic use not yet observed'):String(q.value);$('consumer-note').textContent=q.consumer?`Matched use at cycle ${q.consumer.cycle}; ${q.consumer.assembly}; UID ${q.consumer.uid}, PC ${hex(q.consumer.pc)}.`:'This packet populates the replicated result. The recorded receive values and final host readback agree.';
$('instructions').innerHTML=[['Send',m.send_instruction,q.send],['Receive',m.receive_instruction,q.receive]].map(([label,i,e])=>`<div class="instruction"><b>${label}: PE (${i.pe})</b><p class="mono">${esc(i.assembly)}<br>UID ${i.uid} · PC ${hex(i.pc)} · selected S6 row ${e.row}</p><small>${esc(i.source_line||i.source_file)}</small></div>`).join('');
$('message-table').innerHTML=table(['Word','Tensor value','Hex bits','Send S6','Source router','Destination router','Interval','Receive S6','Use'],m.terms.map(t=>[t.slot,esc(t.semantic)+' = '+t.value,hex(t.packet.word),t.send.cycle,t.packet.observations[0].cycle,t.packet.observations[1].cycle,t.packet.interval,t.receive.cycle,t.consumer?.cycle??'—']));
$('control-note').textContent=m.control?`Separate control packet: ident ${m.control.ident} · word ${hex(m.control.word)} · ${m.control.observations.map(o=>o.cycle).join(' → ')}. Control bit set; not decoded as a tensor float.`:'Fixed-extent transfer without a control packet.';
$('source').textContent=`${s.source} · row numbers are 1-based decompressed JSONL lines. ${s.counts.raw_observations} scoped raw observations retained; ${s.counts.unresolved_observations} could not form a unique adjacent-PE pair.`;$('raw').innerHTML=table(['Row','Cycle','PE','Ident','Index high 16','Data low 16','Fields','SDK link code'],q.packet.observations.map(o=>[o.row,o.cycle,o.pe,o.ident,hex(o.index),hex(o.data),hex(o.fields),o.link]));
$('prev').disabled=!times.some(t=>t<cycle);$('next').disabled=!times.some(t=>t>cycle);
}
$('scene').onchange=chooseScene;$('message').onchange=chooseMessage;$('cycle').oninput=e=>{cycle=+e.target.value;render();};for(const [id,sign]of [['prev',-1],['next',1]])$(id).onclick=()=>{const ts=frames(DATA.scenes[si].messages[mi].terms[slot]).map(f=>f.cycle).filter(t=>t!=null&&sign*(t-cycle)>0).sort((a,b)=>sign*(a-b));if(ts.length)cycle=ts[0];render();};$('export').onclick=()=>{const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(DATA,null,2)],{type:'application/json'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='pe-hop-evidence.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000);};chooseScene();
</script></html>
